                <div class="mt-2 date ml-auto" style="display: flex; float:left">14/07/2021</div>
                <ul style="display:flex; float:right; margin-top:10px">
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-genel-baskani-gultekin-uysal-15-temmuz-demokrasi-ve-milli-birlik-gunu-nedeniyle-bir-mesaj-yayinladi"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a></li>
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="https://twitter.com/share?url=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-genel-baskani-gultekin-uysal-15-temmuz-demokrasi-ve-milli-birlik-gunu-nedeniyle-bir-mesaj-yayinladi"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a></li>
                    <li style="margin-right:10px" class="ml-3"><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=https://www.dp.org.tr/haber/demokrat-parti-genel-baskani-gultekin-uysal-15-temmuz-demokrasi-ve-milli-birlik-gunu-nedeniyle-bir-mesaj-yayinladi"><i style="font-size:20px; color:#4D4D4D" class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a></li>
                </ul>
                <h1>Demokrat Parti Genel Başkanı Gültekin Uysal, &quot;15 Temmuz Demokrasi ve Milli Birlik Günü&quot; nedeniyle bir mesaj yayınladı</h1>
                <br>
                <br>
                <br>
                <p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;Bu acı g&uuml;n&uuml;n yıld&ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;nde şehitlerimize rahmet ve minnet dilerken AKP i&ccedil;in akıl fikir temenni ediyoruz&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">(DP Basın Merkezi &ndash; 14 Temmuz 2021) Demokrat Parti Genel Başkanı G&uuml;ltekin Uysal,&nbsp;<strong style="font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">15 Temmuz Demokrasi ve Milli Birlik G&uuml;n&uuml;</span></strong>&nbsp;dolayısıyla bir mesaj yayınladı. Uysal mesajında yaşananlardan ders alınması gerektiğini s&ouml;yleyerek &ldquo;Bu acı g&uuml;n&uuml;n yıld&ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;nde şehitlerimize rahmet ve minnet dilerken AKP i&ccedil;in akıl fikir temenni ediyoruz&rdquo; dedi.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">15 Temmuz&rsquo;da Millet iradesinin millet tarafından korunduğuna dikkat &ccedil;eken Genel Başkan Uysal, demokrasiden kopulmasının 15 Temmuz&rsquo;u yaşatan ter&ouml;rist hainlere zemin yarattığını ifade etti.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;15 Temmuz Demokrasi ve Milli Birlik G&uuml;n&uuml;&rdquo;</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">n&uuml;n 5. yıld&ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;nde yayınladığı mesajda demokrasi ve adaletin milletimizin dertlerinin en iyi ilacı olacağına vurgu yapan Demokrat Parti Genel Başkanı G&uuml;ltekin Uysal, şunları s&ouml;yledi:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;Bir &ccedil;ete doğrudan doğruya eline silah alıp milleti katletmeye yeltendi&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;Bug&uuml;n, tarihimizin ş&uuml;phesiz en acı g&uuml;nlerinden birinin yıl d&ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;. 15 Temmuz teşebb&uuml;s&uuml;; 27 Mayıs ve 12 Eyl&uuml;l&rsquo;&uuml;n yarattığı toplumsal ve siyasal travmadan kurtulmak i&ccedil;in yıllar boyu verilmiş emekleri adeta zayi etmiştir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&Uuml;lkenin g&ouml;rd&uuml;ğ&uuml; en b&uuml;y&uuml;k su&ccedil; teşekk&uuml;l&uuml;n&uuml;n alenileştiği, yıllar boyu itibar suikasti yapan bir &ccedil;etenin doğrudan doğruya eline silah alıp milleti katletmeye yeltendiği bir g&uuml;n&uuml;n yıld&ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;d&uuml;r bug&uuml;n.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">T&uuml;rl&uuml; operasyonlarla milletin iradesini gasp etmişlerdir. İmtiyazlar, kolaylıklar ve g&ouml;z yummalarla kamu otoritesinin kudretini, iktidarını sağlamlaştırmak adına trampa eden bir siyasal anlayışın &uuml;lkeyi getirdiği halin &ouml;zetidir durum&hellip;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;Millet iradesi yine milletin kendisi tarafından korunmuştur&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">250 insanımızın hainler tarafından şehit edilmiştir. 2193 insanımız teşebb&uuml;s sırasında g&ouml;vdesini memlekete siper etmiştir. 15 Temmuz&rsquo;da millet iradesi yine milletin kendisi tarafından korunmuştur.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;Demokrasi i&ccedil;in didinmek yerine demokrasi ile didiştiler&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Evveli hakkında s&ouml;ylenecek onlarca s&ouml;z var muhakkak, lakin 15 Temmuz&rsquo;a nasıl gelindiğinin cevabı, demokrasinin hali ile doğru orantılıdır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Demokrasi kan kaybettik&ccedil;e 15 Temmuz&rsquo;un m&uuml;sebbibi ter&ouml;ristlerin y&uuml;z&uuml;ne kan geldiği aşikardır. Dahası demokrasiden uzaklaşıldığı i&ccedil;in, adaletten kopulduğu i&ccedil;in bu hain s&uuml;r&uuml;s&uuml;n&uuml;n alan kazandığı da bir ger&ccedil;ektir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&Uuml;lkenin kahir ekseriyeti demokrasi i&ccedil;in didinirken, demokrasiyi kendi iktidarı i&ccedil;in risk bilenlerin demokrasi ile, cumhuriyet değer ve kazanımları ile didişmesi 15 Temmuz&rsquo;a giden yolun taşlarını d&ouml;şemiştir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;20 yıldır yapılan her hatanın maliyetini millet &ouml;demiştir&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">D&uuml;n iktidarını muhafaza etmek i&ccedil;in demokrasi ile didişenler bug&uuml;n hepten demokrasinin canına okumaya yeltenmişlerdir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Bunu ise başta 16 Nisan Referandumu ile keyfiyeti anayasal hale getirerek yapmışlardır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Ne acı ki iktidarın 20 yıldır yaptığı her hatanın maliyetini millet &ouml;demiştir, &ouml;demeye de devam etmektedir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;İktidar sorumluluktan kurtulacağını d&uuml;ş&uuml;n&uuml;yor&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">İktidar ise zaman zaman nedamet getirerek sorumluluktan kurtulacağını d&uuml;ş&uuml;n&uuml;yor. &Uuml;stelik ders almak konusunda da diğer bir&ccedil;ok konuda oldukları kadar başarısızlardır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Milletimizin bug&uuml;n yaşananlara uygun veciz &ccedil;ok&ccedil;a deyişi vardır. İ&ccedil;lerinden en uygunu ise sanıyoruz ki&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;&uuml;z&uuml;m &uuml;z&uuml;me baka baka kararır&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>s&ouml;z&uuml;d&uuml;r.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">FET&Ouml; y&ouml;ntemleri olarak bilinen kumpaslar, manip&uuml;lasyonlar bir tarafa, b&uuml;rokratik anlamda yaptıkları aynı ile zuhur etmektedir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;Yaşananlardan bir ders &ccedil;ıkarılamamış&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">D&uuml;n FET&Ouml;&rsquo;n&uuml;n sistemi fel&ccedil; etmek ve kendi lehine işletmek adına ele ge&ccedil;irdiği kurumlar, aynı ele ge&ccedil;irme mantığı ile bu kez iktidarın eline ge&ccedil;miştir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">D&uuml;n yargıda FET&Ouml;&rsquo;n&uuml;n hakimiyeti s&ouml;z konusuyken bug&uuml;n&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;bağımsız yargı&rdquo;</strong>&nbsp;s&ouml;ylemi arkasında yargı&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;keyfiyet&rdquo;</strong>e bağlanmıştır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&ldquo;T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de hukuk yok/adalet işlemiyor&rdquo;</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;dediğimiz, denetimsiz bir idari anlayışın, dengesiz/orantısız bir siyasi g&uuml;c&uuml;n varlığının sonu 15 Temmuz&rsquo;a &ccedil;ıkmıştır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">G&ouml;r&uuml;nen o ki yaşananlardan bir ders &ccedil;ıkarılamamıştır. Geldiğimiz noktada hala T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;de adalet işlememekte, denetlenmesi gerekenler denetlenememekte, iktidar g&uuml;c&uuml;n&uuml; kamunun kendisine tanıdığı imkanları k&ouml;t&uuml;ye kullanarak her ge&ccedil;en g&uuml;n arttırmaktadır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;Her halde&rdquo; değil, &ldquo;OHAL&rdquo;de kazanırız diye umuyorlar</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Yapmak isteyip hukukun izin vermemesi nedeniyle yapamadıkları i&ccedil;in OHAL şartlarına hamd eden siyasal iktidarın şimdiki gayreti niyetlerini a&ccedil;ık etmektedir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Bug&uuml;ne kadar 3 defa uzatılan OHAL ile alakalı Meclise sunulan torba teklif kimi OHAL uygulamalarının 3 yıl daha uzatılmasını teklif etmektedir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;&Uuml;lkeyi OHAL sopası ile y&ouml;netmek istiyorlar&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Basit bir hesap ise 2023 yılında ger&ccedil;ekleşeceğini s&ouml;yledikleri se&ccedil;ime kadar &uuml;lkeyi OHAL sopası ile y&ouml;netmek istediklerini g&ouml;stermektedir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">İktidar bug&uuml;ne kadar g&uuml;c&uuml;n&uuml;n form&uuml;lasyonunda&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;milli irade&rdquo;</strong>&nbsp;vurgusu yapmış ancak bu girişimle form&uuml;l&uuml; değiştirdiğini g&ouml;stermiştir. Ger&ccedil;i son olarak yerel se&ccedil;imlerde kazanmak i&ccedil;in nelere tevess&uuml;l edeceğinin bir sim&uuml;lasyonu da sergilenmiştir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Olağan şartlarda se&ccedil;im kazanması ve hamd etmesi imkansız hale gelen AKP, hamd etmek i&ccedil;in OHAL&rsquo;e bel bağlamıştır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">AKP i&ccedil;in artık iktidarın form&uuml;l&uuml; değişmiştir; yıllarca &ldquo;her halde&rdquo; kazanırım diyen AKP artık ancak OHAL&rsquo;de kazanacağını d&uuml;ş&uuml;nmektedir.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;Akletmez misiniz?&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">15 Temmuz&rsquo;a giden s&uuml;re&ccedil;te yapılanları aynı ile tekrarlayarak, muhalefeti ter&ouml;rize ederek, toplumu kutuplaştırarak, yargıyı etki altına alarak ve OHAL&rsquo;e bel bağlayarak T&uuml;rkiye&rsquo;yi yeni ve daha b&uuml;y&uuml;k risklere maruz bıraktıklarını g&ouml;rmemeleri, iktidar hırsı ile g&ouml;zlerinin k&ouml;r olmasındandır.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Kadim ve ilahi bir soru sormak gerekmektedir; akletmez misiniz?</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Ge&ccedil;mişte yaptıklarınızın sadece 15 Temmuz&rsquo;da değil &ouml;ncesinde ve sonrasında nelere mal olduğunu, sizlerin koltuğunu koruduğunu ancak milletin ne gibi maliyetlere maruz kaldığını g&ouml;rmez misiniz? Anlaşılan g&ouml;rmezsiniz!</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;">&ldquo;Demokrasinin ve adaletin &ouml;nemini bir kez daha hatırlatmak istiyoruz&rdquo;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Bu acı g&uuml;n&uuml;n yıld&ouml;n&uuml;m&uuml;nde şehitlerimize rahmet ve minnet dilerken AKP i&ccedil;in akıl fikir temenni ediyoruz.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #444444; mso-fareast-language: TR;">Bir daha b&ouml;yle acıların yaşanmaması i&ccedil;in dua ediyor ve umursamayacaklarını bilsek de d&uuml;n i&ccedil;in &ouml;nlem olanın, bug&uuml;nk&uuml; sıkıntılara ila&ccedil; olacağını, yani demokrasinin ve adaletin &ouml;nemini bir kez daha hatırlatmak istiyoruz.&rdquo;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Verdana','sans-serif';">&nbsp;</span></p></p>
            </div>
        </div>
            </div>
</section>


